{"id":"6f4e11aea39794a8","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic-biimmune.md","title":"1-generic 及其补集都免疫","display":"thm-generic-biimmune — 1-generic 及其补集都免疫","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic-biimmune","aliases":["20-thm-generic-biimmune"],"display":"thm-generic-biimmune — 1-generic 及其补集都免疫","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.5(i)","source_printed_pages":[138],"source_pdf_pages":[172],"depends_on":["[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-immune]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic-biimmune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic-biimmune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-biimmune — 1-generic 及其补集都免疫"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.5(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"991aaed4a87c5835\" href=\"?note=991aaed4a87c5835\" title=\"20-df-immune\">20-df-immune</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(G\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\">\\(\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"991aaed4a87c5835\" href=\"?note=991aaed4a87c5835\" title=\"20-df-immune\">20-df-immune</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}biimmune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Immune}(G)\\land\\operatorname{Immune}(\\omega\\setminus G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}biimmune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Immune}(G)\\land\\operatorname{Immune}(\\omega\\setminus G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b&lt;2\">\\(b&lt;2\\)</span>，含有某个位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ge n\">\\(x\\ge n\\)</span> 且该位为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的有限串组成可计算稠密集，generic 必须碰到它。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 和补集均无限。</p>\n<p>若无限 c.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq G\">\\(W\\subseteq G\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists x\\in W\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\ [\\sigma(x)=0]\\}\">\\(S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists x\\in W\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\ [\\sigma(x)=0]\\}\\)</span>。这是 c.e. 串集合，真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不会碰到它；但每个有限前缀之外仍有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 的元素，可在该位写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，所以没有前缀能避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，矛盾。对补集把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.3.5(i)；印刷页 138；PDF 第 172 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-immune","status":"resolved","id":"991aaed4a87c5835","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-immune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-immune]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-immune","status":"resolved","id":"991aaed4a87c5835","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-immune]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}biimmune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Immune}(G)\\land\\operatorname{Immune}(\\omega\\setminus G).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"b<2","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ge n","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq G","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists x\\in W\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\ [\\sigma(x)=0]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"f45e31a03f051bd8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-generic-exists]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。"},{"id":"54d630bb92c94299","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]；see [[20-thm-1gen-low]]。"},{"id":"93cbfd6e6986f453","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。"}],"outgoing":["b03a71cd282632fa","991aaed4a87c5835"]}